  "dur": 14.283,
  "text": "Now picture lifting a weight with a rubber band, then with a steel cable. The rubber band stretches first, and the weight moves late. The cable moves it instantly. Stiffer tendons work like that cable, and studies link stiffer tendons to faster,"
